      "repositoryPath": "projects/chirality-app-v4/execution/PKG-04/DEL-04-03/Design/RECORD_SEMANTICS.md",
      "readExtent": "13.8 Agent access: owner decision, scope, direction and quoted standing; 13.9 When it is used (direction)",
      "selectors": [
        {
          "linePrefix": "- **Agent access** (owner, 2026-10-12:"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  outside the agent's writable workspace. The App gives agents a read-only"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  records capability scoped to the current project, which they use when the"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  person or the workflow directs them to rebuild context. The App decides what"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  it returns: never keys and never another project's records. It marks what"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  it returns as quoted evidence, not authority (OF-2), and records each read"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  (§13.9)."
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "- **When it is used (direction).**"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  product guidance say to use it"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  only when the person or the workflow directs the agent to rebuild context"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  from the records; a person's message or a workflow's text gives that"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  direction in the conversation. The App cannot tell a directed call from an"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  undirected one, so it does not try: every call is recorded and shown, and"
        },
        {
          "linePrefix": "  what it returns is bounded and marked."
        }
      ],
